{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"943","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"【永續論壇活動】11/24(二)中科管理局「永續論壇暨廢棄物績優表揚」,歡迎踴躍報名","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 20pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black;\\\">永續發展是企業經營的目標，企業社會責任</span></span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black;\\\">(CSR)</span></span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black;\\\">是國際經營策略的主流，不僅能提升公司形象，更能擴散影響至企業供應鏈。本次宣導說明會特邀請財團法人台灣永續能源研究基金會簡又新董事長分享最新</span></span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black;\\\">CSR</span></span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black;\\\">國際趨勢，並透過園區事業分享「減廢與資源循環經驗及技術」，以期協助園區事業借鑑資源循環之創新做法，掌握永續先機。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: \\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; background-ima